From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ssch71 <s01093450498@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] DisplayContent: Scale the base display cutout from the physical size

updateBaseDisplayCutout() passed the current mode size as the physical
display size, so the cutout spec was rescaled against 720x1600 in HD mode
and the status bar inset doubled. Pass mPhysicalDisplaySize (the maximum
resolution mode), matching AOSP.
---
--- a/smali_classes2/com/android/server/wm/DisplayContent.smali
+++ b/smali_classes2/com/android/server/wm/DisplayContent.smali
@@ -25711,6 +25711,12 @@
 
     move v7, v5
 
+    iget-object v0, p0, Lcom/android/server/wm/DisplayContent;->mPhysicalDisplaySize:Landroid/graphics/Point;
+
+    iget v4, v0, Landroid/graphics/Point;->x:I
+
+    iget v5, v0, Landroid/graphics/Point;->y:I
+
     invoke-static/range {v2 .. v9}, Landroid/view/DisplayCutout;->fromResourcesRectApproximation(Landroid/content/res/Resources;Ljava/lang/String;IIIIIZ)Landroid/view/DisplayCutout;
 
     move-result-object p1
